      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Sagesse, gentillesse et bravoure sont les mots qui qualifient le mieux ce Pokémon, devenu l’inséparable partenaire des équipes de secours.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/27/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Intelligent, good-natured, and valiant, it’s a trustworthy partner on rescue teams.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/27/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "賢く　温厚で　勇敢。 レスキュー隊の　隊員たちの 頼れる　相棒　だぞ。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/27/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Modèle de sagesse, il ne s’en prend jamais aux humains sans raison, et assume volontiers le rôle de nounou pour les parents occupés.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "With this wise Pokémon, there could be no concern that it would ever attack people. Some parents even trust it to babysit.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "賢く　人に　襲い掛かる 心配が　ないので　子どもの お守りを　任せる　親も　いる。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Son long pelage le protège parfaitement du froid. Malheureusement pour lui, cela n’est pas très utile à Alola.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "It pays no mind to the cold, thanks to its long warm coat. Stoutland in Alola look a little uncomfortable.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "長く　暖かい　毛の　おかげで 寒さは　へっちゃら。　アローラの ムーランドは　少し　苦しそうだ。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Il possède un pelage long et épais. Jadis, dans les régions froides, chaque foyer en élevait un.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Its fur is long and thick. A long time ago in cold regions, every household kept a Stoutland.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "長く　厚手の　体毛を　もつ。 昔は　寒い　地方では　一家に １匹　ムーランドを　飼っていた。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Il apprécierait tant la compagnie des êtres humains qu’il ne faudrait pas plus de trois jours pour apprivoiser un Mastouffe sauvage.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "These Pokémon seem to enjoy living with humans. Even a Stoutland caught in the wild will warm up to people in about three days.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "人と　暮らすのが　好きらしい。 野生で　捕まえても　3日も たてば　人に　懐くようになる。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Sa moustache remarquable fait sa fierté, car sa longueur permettrait de déterminer la hiérarchie au sein de l’espèce.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "shield",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/34/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Stoutland is immensely proud of its impressive moustache. It’s said that moustache length is what determines social standing among this species.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "shield",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/34/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "立派なヒゲが　自慢の　ポケモン。 その　長さで　仲間同士の 優劣が　決まると　いう。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
